WEBVTT

00:00:04.080 --> 00:00:06.250
Hide by those rocks! Hurry!

00:00:11.750 --> 00:00:13.710
What a massive hole.

00:00:13.710 --> 00:00:15.880
It must have opened with that eruption.

00:00:16.250 --> 00:00:18.080
Watch out, everyone.

00:00:19.500 --> 00:00:22.250
There's a salamander down there!

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:25.500
A salamander?

00:00:25.500 --> 00:00:26.670
No way...

00:00:26.670 --> 00:00:28.380
Damn, I can't get a good view.

00:00:30.210 --> 00:00:31.630
Do you want to die, you idiot?!

00:00:31.630 --> 00:00:32.750
S-sorry.

00:00:33.170 --> 00:00:35.000
What'll we do, Ms. Owner?

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:38.540
It's not even a question,
considering our current equipment...

00:00:38.540 --> 00:00:40.080
Hmm? What's that?

00:00:42.500 --> 00:00:44.080
Something seems strange...

00:00:44.080 --> 00:00:46.960
Let's slowly move away
from here, everyone.

00:00:46.960 --> 00:00:49.420
If we accidentally agitate it
and it uses its breath attack...

00:00:51.580 --> 00:00:52.790
Air wall!

00:00:53.750 --> 00:00:55.960
Those flames are way too strong!

00:00:56.710 --> 00:00:57.830
Ms. Owner!

00:01:01.000 --> 00:01:02.040
Now's our chance!

00:01:02.040 --> 00:01:03.750
Run for it!

00:01:16.630 --> 00:01:20.790
Starting today, I can see a small star

00:01:20.790 --> 00:01:24.210
Shining bright in my heart

00:01:24.210 --> 00:01:27.500
Whether crying, laughing, or shining

00:01:27.500 --> 00:01:29.710
I'll roll up my sleeves and get walking

00:01:29.710 --> 00:01:32.920
(It'll definitely be alright, give your worries the go sign)

00:01:32.920 --> 00:01:35.170
(Let's do this right)

00:01:36.630 --> 00:01:42.540
Being free can feel so restricting

00:01:42.540 --> 00:01:45.920
After all, it never ends

00:01:45.920 --> 00:01:49.330
This spiral of theoretical values and test results

00:01:49.790 --> 00:01:51.420
Whether I win or lose

00:01:51.420 --> 00:01:53.000
(No matter what I try)

00:01:53.000 --> 00:01:54.670
I work hard to see my dream come true

00:01:54.670 --> 00:01:56.500
(It's not a cheat, it's a life hack)

00:01:56.500 --> 00:01:59.960
I've got the license to take my proper first step

00:01:59.960 --> 00:02:02.210
This is just the beginning

00:02:02.380 --> 00:02:06.460
Starting today, I can see a small star

00:02:06.460 --> 00:02:09.830
Shining bright in my heart

00:02:09.830 --> 00:02:13.210
Whether crying, laughing, or shining

00:02:13.210 --> 00:02:15.790
I take a deep breath before work

00:02:15.790 --> 00:02:19.960
Resound, as I reach out towards a whole new world

00:02:19.960 --> 00:02:23.290
My dream is surely in my hands

00:02:23.290 --> 00:02:26.750
An original only I can make

00:02:26.750 --> 00:02:29.460
Open that door and say welcome

00:02:29.460 --> 00:02:31.960
(This is the start)

00:02:31.960 --> 00:02:35.460
(It'll definitely be alright, give your worries the go sign)

00:02:35.460 --> 00:02:37.880
(Let's do this right)

00:02:40.670 --> 00:02:43.210
That's the full report on our investigation.

00:02:44.080 --> 00:02:49.710
So you're saying that there isn't any risk of
another hellflame grizzly frenzy, right?

00:02:49.710 --> 00:02:50.540
That's right.

00:02:50.540 --> 00:02:54.080
So, is there any risk of those
lava lizards or that salamander

00:02:54.080 --> 00:02:56.000
coming here to the village?

00:02:56.290 --> 00:02:59.000
Well... I don't think so.

00:02:59.000 --> 00:03:02.290
They aren't generally the sort of
monsters to leave their territory.

00:03:02.290 --> 00:03:04.080
That's a relief.

00:03:04.080 --> 00:03:06.670
But I believe we should
keep up our watch,

00:03:06.670 --> 00:03:08.830
in order to prepare for any
unexpected situations.

00:03:08.830 --> 00:03:09.880
Right.

00:03:10.080 --> 00:03:13.330
I'll make sure to reward you properly
for your assistance.

00:03:13.330 --> 00:03:18.170
Kate and Iris, would you be fine with
two times what you normally earn in a day,

00:03:18.170 --> 00:03:20.000
and then several days' worth?

00:03:20.000 --> 00:03:20.960
That sounds fine.

00:03:20.960 --> 00:03:21.880
Agreed.

00:03:21.880 --> 00:03:25.630
I'll try to think of something besides
just money for you, Sarasa.

00:03:25.630 --> 00:03:28.170
Right, I'll leave that to you, Ms. Elyn.

00:03:28.170 --> 00:03:31.250
I'll stop by at a later date,
after consulting with my father.

00:03:35.540 --> 00:03:40.460
I'd heard of salamanders in stories,
but I never really knew that existed...

00:03:40.460 --> 00:03:42.290
Yes, that thing was trouble.

00:03:42.750 --> 00:03:45.670
I couldn't see too well,
but it looked quite massive.

00:03:46.170 --> 00:03:49.960
Salamanders are supposed to be
around five meters long.

00:03:49.960 --> 00:03:53.000
No way, it was clearly larger than that!

00:03:53.000 --> 00:03:55.000
What do you think, Ms. Owner?

00:03:55.630 --> 00:03:56.670
Ms. Owner?

00:03:56.670 --> 00:03:57.580
Huh?

00:03:57.580 --> 00:03:59.710
Is it not to your taste?

00:03:59.710 --> 00:04:01.670
No, that's not it at all!

00:04:01.670 --> 00:04:04.170
It's totally delicious! So good!

00:04:04.880 --> 00:04:07.080
I was just doing a bit of thinking...

00:04:07.080 --> 00:04:08.290
Thinking?

00:04:08.290 --> 00:04:09.580
About what?

00:04:09.750 --> 00:04:13.830
Well... that we might just
be able to resolve

00:04:13.830 --> 00:04:15.880
the problem your house
is facing, Ms. Iris!

00:04:15.880 --> 00:04:16.630
What?!

00:04:16.630 --> 00:04:17.790
Do you mean it?!

00:04:17.790 --> 00:04:20.710
Yeah, though it'll be really dangerous...

00:04:21.750 --> 00:04:23.040
Hold on a moment...!

00:04:23.040 --> 00:04:26.040
Ms. Owner, you're not talking about
taking down the salamander, are you?!

00:04:26.040 --> 00:04:27.080
Huh?!

00:04:27.080 --> 00:04:28.040
I am...

00:04:28.040 --> 00:04:30.330
If we could get ahold of
the ingredients from it,

00:04:30.330 --> 00:04:33.250
we could earn enough money
to pay off your debt.

00:04:33.250 --> 00:04:34.790
The issue would be finding a buyer,

00:04:34.790 --> 00:04:37.380
but if I consult with my master,
I believe it should work out.

00:04:37.580 --> 00:04:40.420
But we could never beat
something like that!

00:04:40.420 --> 00:04:44.000
That's right! Even I know
how dangerous a salamander is!

00:04:44.000 --> 00:04:47.000
I'm obviously not asking
the two of you to face it alone.

00:04:47.000 --> 00:04:48.540
That would be suicide.

00:04:48.880 --> 00:04:54.040
Could you defeat even a monster
on that level in no time flat, Ms. Owner?

00:04:54.040 --> 00:04:57.380
No... I could never handle it on my own.

00:04:57.830 --> 00:05:00.880
But with the two of you assisting...

00:05:00.880 --> 00:05:04.040
If you'll be coming, we'll offer
as much assistance as you need.

00:05:04.040 --> 00:05:07.290
But we can't let you face
such danger for us...

00:05:07.540 --> 00:05:11.210
I want to take that salamander down too!

00:05:11.500 --> 00:05:12.670
Ms. Owner...

00:05:12.670 --> 00:05:15.460
How are you actually planning on beating it?

00:05:15.460 --> 00:05:19.460
Well, I've got something like a trump card
I can rely on for that.

00:05:19.960 --> 00:05:21.290
A trump card...?

00:05:22.710 --> 00:05:24.000
Another earthquake?!

00:05:24.000 --> 00:05:26.000
We've been getting a lot of them lately...

00:05:30.960 --> 00:05:32.540
I read your letter.

00:05:32.540 --> 00:05:35.710
If there's a salamander about,
that certainly is a concern.

00:05:37.580 --> 00:05:40.580
If the salamander runs wild
and the lava starts flowing,

00:05:40.580 --> 00:05:43.880
the ecosystem will collapse,
and it will have an impact on a huge scale.

00:05:43.880 --> 00:05:47.580
And if there's an eruption,
the village won't stand a chance.

00:05:47.830 --> 00:05:49.750
The salamander must be
the cause of the earthquakes

00:05:49.750 --> 00:05:51.670
that have been occurring in the area as well.

00:05:51.670 --> 00:05:54.380
The way it's been shifting the ley lines

00:05:54.380 --> 00:05:57.080
may also have caused that incident
with the transfer circle.

00:05:57.460 --> 00:06:01.380
Could I possibly defeat
such a powerful monster...?

00:06:01.380 --> 00:06:05.790
At their normal strength, you should
be fine if you give it your all.

00:06:06.670 --> 00:06:08.880
Okay, I'll go for it!

00:06:09.830 --> 00:06:10.830
Alright!

00:06:12.380 --> 00:06:16.500
What was your adorable apprentice
contacting you about?

00:06:20.630 --> 00:06:22.000
Huh?!

00:06:22.210 --> 00:06:23.580
The volcano's erupting?!

00:06:23.580 --> 00:06:24.290
When?!

00:06:24.290 --> 00:06:26.790
Ah no, I wasn't talking about anything soon.

00:06:26.790 --> 00:06:30.710
Just something I fear could happen
if we leave the salamander be...

00:06:32.250 --> 00:06:34.670
It's true that there have been
a lot of quakes lately.

00:06:34.670 --> 00:06:36.290
What'll we do...?

00:06:36.290 --> 00:06:38.170
Don't worry, Lorea.

00:06:38.170 --> 00:06:42.250
If we defeat the salamander,
Ms. Iris can repay her debt,

00:06:42.250 --> 00:06:44.670
and we can nip that worry in the bud too.

00:06:45.460 --> 00:06:48.170
Right! I believe in you, Ms. Sarasa!

00:06:48.170 --> 00:06:51.960
And so, we'll begin working on
preparations starting today!

00:06:53.960 --> 00:06:55.920
In order to take down the salamander,

00:06:55.920 --> 00:06:59.250
we'll need protection to withstand
that breath attack and the high heat.

00:06:59.630 --> 00:07:01.130
I'll hurry to make those

00:07:01.130 --> 00:07:05.080
using ingredients from the
lava lizards and hellflame grizzlies.

00:07:09.130 --> 00:07:14.130
Ms. Kate and Ms. Iris, I want you to
gather pelts to use for the lining.

00:07:15.460 --> 00:07:17.170
I'm going to eat you!

00:07:20.960 --> 00:07:23.250
Once things look good with
the protective gear,

00:07:23.250 --> 00:07:26.960
I'll use the ingredients from
the frostfang bats

00:07:26.960 --> 00:07:29.920
to prepare ice arrows and
ice crystals until you return.

00:07:31.130 --> 00:07:34.380
However, I'll likely still come up short,

00:07:34.380 --> 00:07:37.750
so I'll ask Ms. Leonora over in
South Straug to assist as well.

00:07:38.130 --> 00:07:41.420
I'd like to ask Mr. Darna
to transport them...

00:07:41.420 --> 00:07:43.250
I'll let him know!

00:07:56.750 --> 00:07:59.080
Once the two of you are back,

00:07:59.080 --> 00:08:02.670
we'll handle the rest of the process
to finish up our protective gear.

00:08:02.960 --> 00:08:03.960
Ow!

00:08:05.670 --> 00:08:08.580
The map of the volcano
I'm having my master prepare

00:08:08.580 --> 00:08:10.830
should arrive around then.

00:08:11.500 --> 00:08:13.920
As should the goods from Ms. Leonora.

00:08:14.330 --> 00:08:18.250
It should take roughly two weeks
to get all of our preparations in order...

00:08:29.040 --> 00:08:30.790
Ms. Sarasa, for today...

00:08:31.330 --> 00:08:32.790
Ms. Sarasa?!

00:08:33.330 --> 00:08:36.670
Geez, this is why I said you needed to sleep!

00:08:36.670 --> 00:08:40.790
It's fine... I'll sleep properly tonight...

00:08:41.130 --> 00:08:46.170
Ah, but could you make some
delicious food to eat first?

00:08:47.210 --> 00:08:49.420
Of course! I'll make a whole lot!

00:08:58.000 --> 00:08:59.000
Everybody!

00:08:59.790 --> 00:09:01.420
Here's today's special!

00:09:20.920 --> 00:09:23.790
Thanks for helping out today, everyone!

00:09:24.170 --> 00:09:28.670
We don't mind, but you really just want us
to accompany you on the way there?

00:09:28.670 --> 00:09:32.540
Yes, since I didn't have enough ingredients
to make protective gear for everyone.

00:09:32.540 --> 00:09:35.330
And we didn't have time
to hunt down more either.

00:09:35.330 --> 00:09:39.170
Well, I get that cooling hats
won't exactly cut it here.

00:09:39.540 --> 00:09:41.960
But still, hearing that
the village is in danger...

00:09:41.960 --> 00:09:45.830
Just being there to carry our luggage
really is a huge help.

00:09:46.040 --> 00:09:48.580
Got it. Just leave that to us.

00:09:48.580 --> 00:09:49.880
Mr. Andre...

00:09:50.210 --> 00:09:52.170
Thanks for the help!

00:09:52.170 --> 00:09:53.670
I'm truly grateful!

00:09:53.670 --> 00:09:54.880
Hey, cut it out!

00:09:54.880 --> 00:09:57.420
You don't need to act so formal around us.

00:09:57.420 --> 00:09:58.790
That's right.

00:09:59.210 --> 00:10:02.210
Just go ahead and give it all you've got
to take down that salamander.

00:10:05.170 --> 00:10:07.540
Well then, let's get going!

00:10:11.330 --> 00:10:12.790
Please take care.

00:10:12.790 --> 00:10:14.000
We'll be fine!

00:10:14.000 --> 00:10:17.170
But if anything happens, be sure
to put your own safety first, okay?

00:10:17.170 --> 00:10:18.170
Right.

00:10:21.210 --> 00:10:23.380
Take care!

00:10:58.750 --> 00:11:01.080
Going from here,
it would be far too reckless

00:11:01.080 --> 00:11:05.380
to try to descend down that hole where
we saw the salamander the other day.

00:11:05.670 --> 00:11:08.460
If it launches a breath attack,
we can't avoid it...

00:11:08.460 --> 00:11:10.420
Hmm, then what shall we do?

00:11:10.420 --> 00:11:11.750
According to the map,

00:11:11.750 --> 00:11:14.670
there are a number of lava tubes
running through the mountain.

00:11:14.670 --> 00:11:17.500
Considering the point where it collapsed,

00:11:17.500 --> 00:11:20.710
this cave here should likely be connected.

00:11:20.710 --> 00:11:21.830
I see.

00:11:21.830 --> 00:11:24.080
So we've got to climb up
a bit further from here.

00:11:24.080 --> 00:11:26.790
Alright, so we should go ahead
and get moving?

00:11:27.920 --> 00:11:29.790
Right, let's get going!

00:11:29.790 --> 00:11:30.830
Yeah!

00:11:39.330 --> 00:11:40.460
Look there!

00:11:42.630 --> 00:11:43.750
That's...

00:11:44.460 --> 00:11:45.880
Lava!

00:11:46.130 --> 00:11:49.040
It wasn't like that
last time we came here.

00:11:49.040 --> 00:11:51.880
And there are more lava lizards too.

00:11:51.880 --> 00:11:53.500
In just two weeks...?

00:11:54.080 --> 00:11:57.960
It looks like your perception
may just have hit the mark, Sarasa.

00:12:02.250 --> 00:12:03.540
So that's the place?

00:12:03.540 --> 00:12:04.710
Ms. Owner...

00:12:04.710 --> 00:12:06.250
I'm certain of it.

00:12:06.250 --> 00:12:09.790
I can sense a terribly strong
magical power coming from inside.

00:12:10.040 --> 00:12:13.420
Even if just vaguely,
even I can tell it's really something.

00:12:13.420 --> 00:12:16.710
And there's an incredible heat.
I can feel it even from here.

00:12:16.710 --> 00:12:18.920
This is far enough, everyone.

00:12:18.920 --> 00:12:21.330
Yeah, sorry, but we'll stop here.

00:12:21.330 --> 00:12:23.290
There's no point in being stubborn.

00:12:23.460 --> 00:12:26.790
Could you go ahead and
prepare a camp at a safe distance?

00:12:26.790 --> 00:12:27.790
No problem.

00:12:27.790 --> 00:12:30.380
And make sure not to
push yourselves, okay?!

00:12:30.380 --> 00:12:33.000
What matters most
is making it back alive.

00:12:33.000 --> 00:12:35.290
Where there's life, there's hope.

00:12:35.290 --> 00:12:36.670
Right, understood!

00:12:36.670 --> 00:12:40.670
We'll make it back for sure,
with the salamander to show everyone!

00:12:44.420 --> 00:12:46.250
Well then, let's get going!

00:13:00.000 --> 00:13:03.000
It's finally time to face off
with the salamander...

00:13:03.250 --> 00:13:07.250
Normally it'd be an awful enemy to face,
but now it'll be our salvation.

00:13:07.250 --> 00:13:09.210
If we actually beat it, that is...

00:13:09.210 --> 00:13:10.170
Right...

00:13:10.290 --> 00:13:13.500
I'm truly sorry for relying on you
so heavily, Ms. Owner.

00:13:13.500 --> 00:13:15.500
Please, don't worry about it!

00:13:15.500 --> 00:13:17.500
Once the Lotze family's debt is cleared,

00:13:17.500 --> 00:13:20.580
you'll be able to focus on
repaying what you owe me!

00:13:20.580 --> 00:13:21.750
Of course!

00:13:21.750 --> 00:13:22.540
Yeah!

00:13:22.540 --> 00:13:27.170
But I'd appreciate it if you could be
a little lenient on the timeframe...

00:13:27.170 --> 00:13:28.830
That's fully understandable.

00:13:28.830 --> 00:13:30.670
No need to push yourselves.

00:13:30.670 --> 00:13:31.630
That's a big help!

00:13:31.630 --> 00:13:32.630
Thank you!

00:13:57.420 --> 00:13:58.750
Are you scared?

00:13:59.250 --> 00:14:00.460
Ms. Owner...

00:14:00.790 --> 00:14:03.750
It's not the sort of opponent you'd
normally go up against, after all.

00:14:03.750 --> 00:14:06.710
To be honest, very much so.

00:14:06.710 --> 00:14:09.130
It's the sort of enemy we could
normally never possibly beat.

00:14:09.130 --> 00:14:11.670
It'll be our first time
in a fight like this, won't it?

00:14:11.670 --> 00:14:13.830
Ah, you don't need to fight.

00:14:13.830 --> 00:14:17.250
You just need to help buy time
and offer support.

00:14:17.250 --> 00:14:18.420
We know.

00:14:18.420 --> 00:14:20.290
We'll give our all to back you up.

00:14:20.290 --> 00:14:22.750
But aren't you scared, Ms. Owner?

00:14:23.500 --> 00:14:25.920
Well, I suppose I am...

00:14:26.540 --> 00:14:30.500
But I don't want to lose any more
of the people I care about.

00:14:44.630 --> 00:14:45.790
We're here...

00:15:12.630 --> 00:15:13.710
A trump card...?

00:15:13.710 --> 00:15:15.540
What do you mean...?

00:15:15.830 --> 00:15:20.330
Well, I'll remove the pendant
that restricts my magical power,

00:15:20.330 --> 00:15:22.210
and fire off magic at full force.

00:15:22.830 --> 00:15:25.920
You mean like back at the lake?

00:15:26.170 --> 00:15:28.420
That sounds like it would be truly amazing...

00:15:28.880 --> 00:15:32.830
However, this magic will need
some time to activate.

00:15:32.830 --> 00:15:35.130
And it will use up
all of my magical power,

00:15:35.130 --> 00:15:38.460
so in all likelihood I won't be able
to move afterwards.

00:15:38.790 --> 00:15:41.000
So that's what you meant by
needing our assistance.

00:15:46.540 --> 00:15:49.580
If it seems like you'll be putting yourselves
at risk running away while carrying me,

00:15:49.580 --> 00:15:51.170
then you can just leave me behind.

00:15:51.170 --> 00:15:52.290
As if we could do such a thing!

00:15:52.290 --> 00:15:55.130
We're getting you back safely,
no matter what happens!

00:15:56.500 --> 00:16:02.080
By the way, those ice arrows you have there,
sell for 4,000 rhea each, Ms. Kate.

00:16:02.580 --> 00:16:06.080
And Ms. Iris, just one of those
ice crystals would be 3,500 rhea.

00:16:06.080 --> 00:16:08.710
Wh-why are you telling us that now?!

00:16:08.920 --> 00:16:11.670
Now that you've heard that,
you won't miss, right?

00:16:17.630 --> 00:16:18.710
Here it comes!

00:16:31.500 --> 00:16:33.130
How is that thing five meters long?!

00:16:33.130 --> 00:16:34.290
It's at least double that!

00:16:34.290 --> 00:16:35.920
We'll still stick to the plan!

00:16:35.920 --> 00:16:36.880
Understood!

00:16:43.460 --> 00:16:44.830
Ice needle!

00:16:53.920 --> 00:16:56.750
Well, no surprise that wouldn't be enough...

00:16:57.960 --> 00:16:58.830
Take this!

00:17:04.250 --> 00:17:05.250
Alright!

00:17:12.420 --> 00:17:14.630
Oh winds of the frozen earth...!

00:17:23.250 --> 00:17:25.210
Is there no stopping it?!

00:17:25.210 --> 00:17:26.380
Ms. Owner!

00:17:31.330 --> 00:17:34.750
Oh calm, dark night that permits
not so much as a sound...!

00:17:46.960 --> 00:17:48.330
Ms. Owner!

00:17:50.630 --> 00:17:54.460
Stop all motion,
bringing all to tranquil calm...

00:17:57.130 --> 00:18:00.420
Who's the idiot who said we should
take down a salamander?!

00:18:00.750 --> 00:18:02.330
That's right, me!

00:18:02.330 --> 00:18:06.170
I normally wouldn't get involved
with someone else's debt!

00:18:06.750 --> 00:18:08.880
But we were talking about Ms. Iris...!

00:18:09.580 --> 00:18:10.420
Iris!

00:18:10.420 --> 00:18:11.790
I'm fine!

00:18:11.790 --> 00:18:13.380
More importantly,
how is the owner doing?!

00:18:16.080 --> 00:18:18.750
I-its breath attack is too strong...!

00:18:18.960 --> 00:18:22.920
At their normal strength, you should
be fine if you give it your all.

00:18:23.170 --> 00:18:26.500
This isn't normal at all!

00:18:26.880 --> 00:18:28.290
Are you okay, Iris?!

00:18:28.500 --> 00:18:31.000
I'm alright. Just lightly burned.

00:18:31.210 --> 00:18:33.040
At this rate, we'll...

00:18:33.040 --> 00:18:34.330
Don't worry!

00:18:34.540 --> 00:18:37.080
We just have to believe in
Ms. Owner and hold out!

00:18:37.080 --> 00:18:39.130
She'll surely take it down!

00:18:39.500 --> 00:18:40.500
Right!

00:18:41.000 --> 00:18:44.540
That's right! I need to do this,
for Ms. Iris and Ms. Kate!

00:18:44.830 --> 00:18:47.580
Grant this wild beast a tranquil rest...!

00:18:53.170 --> 00:18:54.380
Ms. Owner!

00:18:54.670 --> 00:18:58.080
Hurry on over to my side, you two!

00:18:58.080 --> 00:18:58.920
On it!

00:19:06.500 --> 00:19:07.580
Ms. Owner!

00:19:07.880 --> 00:19:09.040
Here goes!

00:19:11.290 --> 00:19:13.170
Frozen coffin!

00:19:22.580 --> 00:19:23.580
Amazing!

00:19:23.580 --> 00:19:25.000
To think it'd be this strong!

00:19:25.000 --> 00:19:27.000
This may be bad...

00:19:27.000 --> 00:19:27.790
Huh?

00:19:27.790 --> 00:19:30.830
Normally, it would have
long since frozen over.

00:19:30.830 --> 00:19:33.750
Now it's a question of if
my magical power will hold out...

00:19:35.170 --> 00:19:38.710
If I come up short,
please just leave me be and retreat!

00:19:42.500 --> 00:19:45.380
We would never retreat without you.

00:19:45.630 --> 00:19:49.420
That's right!
We're with you to the bitter end!

00:19:49.670 --> 00:19:51.130
You two...

00:19:52.080 --> 00:19:54.040
I'll give it all I've got!

00:20:00.250 --> 00:20:02.750
Oh no... My magical power...

00:20:03.380 --> 00:20:07.460
It's at... its limit...

00:20:10.460 --> 00:20:11.460
Not yet!

00:20:12.580 --> 00:20:15.210
Your magical power can still go further!

00:20:15.670 --> 00:20:17.250
That voice...

00:20:17.500 --> 00:20:20.830
Show me the willpower of
Sarasa Feed, alchemist!

00:20:49.000 --> 00:20:50.170
Ms. Sarasa...

00:21:00.880 --> 00:21:03.130
Did we beat it...?

00:21:03.500 --> 00:21:05.380
Well, Ms. Owner?

00:21:05.880 --> 00:21:09.750
Sorry... Normally I'd be able to tell.

00:21:09.750 --> 00:21:12.790
But for now,
my magical power has run dry...

00:21:13.250 --> 00:21:14.460
Right.

00:21:14.460 --> 00:21:16.460
Shall we check up close?

00:21:18.920 --> 00:21:24.040
I want closure too, but for now,
I can't guarantee our safety.

00:21:24.040 --> 00:21:26.500
Iris, on the off chance that
something happens,

00:21:26.500 --> 00:21:28.460
we wouldn't be able to deal with it.

00:21:28.460 --> 00:21:33.210
We can come back tomorrow to confirm,
when Ms. Owner can move properly again.

00:21:33.500 --> 00:21:38.750
Right, let's be happy for now
that we made it safely through today.

00:21:39.290 --> 00:21:40.580
That's right...

00:22:24.460 --> 00:22:30.170
The sunlight gently streams in through my window

00:22:30.460 --> 00:22:35.960
Whispering that it's time to get up

00:22:36.380 --> 00:22:42.000
Bringing my anticipation and a bit of courage with me

00:22:42.380 --> 00:22:47.540
I set off to look for a tiny bit of growth

00:22:48.080 --> 00:22:53.880
Peering lightly through the door opened for the first time

00:22:53.880 --> 00:23:01.420
My heart is pounding, alongside plenty of smiles

00:23:02.080 --> 00:23:09.000
Squeezing in plenty of new encounters

00:23:09.000 --> 00:23:14.210
Each time we mingle, a harmony is born

00:23:14.380 --> 00:23:21.250
I want to believe in every possibility

00:23:21.250 --> 00:23:29.290
Just like I believe this sky will be clear again tomorrow

